{
  "_source": "Captured from the Tes uploader DOM and the public taxonomy API on 2026-08-25 (account EBMC, International market), then extended by a live poll on 2026-08-29 (author 28768710, GB market) over GET /api/refdata/v2/<name> and the server-rendered editor state at GET /uploader/v2/<resourceId>. The refdata service has no index endpoint, so names must be known: age-ranges, year-groups, licences, subjects, resource-subjects, country-Codes and salutations answer and everything else 404s. The curriculum cascade is reachable only through the uploader page. Subject/topic tree is fully crawlable at GET /taxonomy/v4/{country}/{id}, unauthenticated.",
  "_status": "complete for every fixed option set the uploader offers; the subject/topic tree is captured per country in tes-taxonomy-GB.json, tes-taxonomy-NZ.json and tes-taxonomy-refs.json, and the 2026-08-29 poll confirmed those captures current at 43 subject roots for each of GB, US, NZ, AU, CA and IE",
